      "id": "1553916462857723915",
      "type": "Reply",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-27T23:49:15.117+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "YAY.\nI'm assuming it's quite possibly better suited for this kind of task?\nGiven that we're not really looking at sub-micron positioning for die-assembly, but rather efective closed-loop-operation for low single digit micron accuracy?",
